sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as KServe Controller Manager
    participant LMOp as LocalModel Operator
    participant LMNAgent as LocalModelNode Agent
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)
    participant AutoGluon as AutoGluon Server<br/>HTTP V1/V2 + gRPC V2
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant KubeRBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS

    Note over User,AutoGluon: Model Deployment Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission webhook<br/>POST /mutate-...-inferenceservice<br/>TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated/Validated CR
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Watch event: InferenceService created

    Manager->>K8sAPI: Get ClusterServingRuntime<br/>(kserve-autogluonserver)
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Runtime spec (autogluon:1)

    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>(autogluonserver container)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Service
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute/VirtualService/Ingress
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Update InferenceService status

    Note over AutoGluon,Storage: Model Loading

    AutoGluon->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 (AWS IAM / Azure AD / GCS SA)
    Storage-->>AutoGluon: Model files (TabularPredictor/TimeSeriesPredictor)
    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: Load AutoGluon model<br/>autogluon.tabular v1.5.0+rhaiv.3

    Note over User,AutoGluon: Inference Request

    User->>AutoGluon: POST /v1/models/model:predict<br/>or POST /v2/models/model/infer
    AutoGluon-->>User: Prediction response (JSON)

    Note over LMOp,LMNAgent: Local Model Caching Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create LocalModelCache CR
    K8sAPI-->>LMOp: Watch event: LocalModelCache created
    LMOp->>K8sAPI: Create PersistentVolume/PVC
    LMOp->>K8sAPI: Create LocalModelNode resources
    K8sAPI-->>LMNAgent: Watch event: LocalModelNode created
    LMNAgent->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1 Job<br/>(download model to local PV)
    LMNAgent->>Storage: Download model to local storage

    Note over Prometheus,KubeRBACProxy: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>KubeRBACProxy: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    KubeRBACProxy->>KubeRBACProxy: Authenticate via TokenReview/SubjectAccessReview
    KubeRBACProxy->>Manager: Proxy to 8080/TCP HTTP
    Manager-->>KubeRBACProxy: Metrics response
    KubeRBACProxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics (authenticated)
